WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:02.390
Here we go!

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:07.090
It's time for another fun day in PriPara!

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:11.030
Hey.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.710
Wow, Hibiki-san!

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.830
Long time no see!  How are Falulu and Fuwari doing?

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.040
And Andou-san! And Toriko-san!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.250
Man, I'm just so happy to see you!

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.400
Calm down.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.200
I watched the first round of the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.220
Congratulations.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.980
Aw, thanks a lot!

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:31.970
This may be somewhat sudden, but I have a present for you to commemorate your victory.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:32.550
Wha?

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:37.460
I mentioned you to a certain well-known PriParisian director, and they're quite taken with you.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.770
In fact, they want you six to star in a movie.

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:44.580
Wha-at? A movie?

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:48.620
And if it does well, more opportunities may come your way.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:52.620
Working with a Parademy Award-winning
director may be your ticket to stardom.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:53.630
Para...

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:58.350
Expectations are high, though.
They don't plan to produce something half-baked.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.240
"Half-baked"...

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.060
Gotcha! We'll be cooking our food all the way through!

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:06.360
We're getting nowhere. There's no point trying to talk with you.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.420
I'll contact Minami to discuss the details.

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:10.560
Capisce!

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.620
A Parademy Award-winning director...

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:22.320
The first step on our road to fame.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:26.210
She'll arrive from PriParis pri much any moment now.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:29.860
Over there...

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:37.760
It's the movie director!

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:52.380
Usa!
Kuma!

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:03.600
Good. Mor. Ning.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:05.930
It spoke?!

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.670
Capisce!

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:10.390
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:12.190
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:15.350
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:18.830
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:21.200
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.700
I can't believe this!

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:01.310
I. Am. Mechanee.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:05.690
<i>This</i> is the director?

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:10.520
I am. A retired model. A first-generation. Meganee.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:14.610
My. Body. Is...

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:15.610
Pushu?

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:27.770
Begin. Filming.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:30.120
Is this thing really a movie director?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.690
She's com-pri-tely different to how I imagined.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:37.610
That's the first-generation Meganee for you-kuma.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:48.320
Up high. Up high.

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.190
I don't even know where to begin.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:55.130
Hibiki-san said she was a Parademy Award-winning auteur director, though-pri.

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:58.200
That's right! She said we had to bake our food properly, too!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:58.770
What?

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:00.800
She's in Pripedia, too.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:03.900
It's in Prench, though, so I can't really read it...

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.850
Lala. Mirei. Sophie.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:10.700
Shion. Dorothy. Reona.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.240
Yes!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:11.620
Aye.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:16.340
Let's make. The greatest movie. Of all time.

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:18.580
Director!

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:21.700
I will decide. The casting.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.730
Eeny. Meeny. Miny. Moe.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.500
Ooh, ooh! I've got your sexy heroine right here!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:34.320
Someone 50,000 people confess love to, or someone who spurns a billion adorers.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:38.500
Pri! If you want a charming, bubbly lead, don't look further than Mirei-pri!

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.960
I may not look like a star, but I played Tree B in our kindergarten play!

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:47.470
Um... I think I'd like to maybe play a princess, if possible...

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:52.330
A common jellyfish, or a Nomura's jellyfish...
I'll take any jellyfish roles you have going!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.680
Waa! Woo!

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.540
I think Jululu wants to be a dog!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.340
I must express my contrition.

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.090
I have no interest in this acting business!

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.360
I am my own Lord!

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:11.180
I am I and no other. Why should I yearn to be other than Toudou Shion?

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.180
That's Shion for you.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.460
She states it in black and white.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:18.770
Shion will play. The lead role. It is decided.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:23.820
This decision. Cannot be reversed.
Until filming. Is complete.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:24.770
Say what?

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:26.480
Congratulations, Shion!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.040
Why does <i>Shion</i> get the lead role?

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.630
It is. Art.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.370
A picture book?

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.110
It is. The script.

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:45.220
I... I wonder what it's going to be like.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:49.310
So Shion's the lead... Is is about a swordswoman or a go player-pri?

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:49.890
Hm?

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:51.900
That doesn't sound <i>too</i> bad...

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.880
Let the story begin!

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:57.230
Shion's going to be playing...

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.960
"Colourful Shion-chan"!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:02.370
"Shio-poyo!"

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:04.040
"I'm Shion-chan!"

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:07.810
"I'm a happy-go-lucky girl from the Land of Rainbows-poyo."

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.160
"Oh no! Oh no! How simply terrible!"

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.560
"I see my friends, and their hearts are crying!"

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.240
"I've gotta poyo cheer them up-poyo!"

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:19.380
"Twirl a cow's tail seven times – that's the magic spell."

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:22.830
"Colourful, colourful, blast those bad feelings away!

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.320
"Ride the rapturous rainbow!"

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:28.720
"Poyon-poyon, poyoyoyoyoon, poyorin, love!"

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.310
"Shio-poyo!"

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:36.140
"Then Shion-chan goes on to the next town, to bring smiles to even more–"

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.230
Too tall an order! Filming rejected!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.430
I guess it won't work after all.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:45.120
Shion's just too different...

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.570
More importantly, I'm not even in it.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.990
I'm not pri-ncluded either! What the pri?

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:51.640
Here.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:55.300
Cow's front legs. Dorothy.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.490
Cow's back legs. Mirei.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:02.080
What's this supposed to pri?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.460
This bucket of bolts is makin' fun of us!

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:13.640
Kuma?

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.940
It is. Art.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.680
We can't pri-scape!

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:21.060
Be born. Anew.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.650
Let's. Reborn!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.230
"Ribbon"?

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.920
No flower. Does not. Bloom.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.940
No serpent. Does not. Moult.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:34.000
No yellowtail. Does not. Leave home.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:37.100
Convenience store. Oden is. Delicious.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:41.490
Break out. Of your cocoon. And be born anew. As a new self.

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:45.230
That is. Acting. That is. Art.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:47.540
Yes. Art.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:50.140
I'm more than satisfied with my current self!

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:52.970
Now, now, just calm down fur a moment.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.360
We'll just take a quick timeout.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.920
Gotta redraw plans-kuma!

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:56.930
Usa!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:01.450
Come on, you've gotta act in this thing-kuma.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.610
I refuse!

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.680
That outfit is scandalous! And saying...

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.600
Sh–Shi...

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:07.360
"Shio-poyo"?

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:12.450
Shion can suck it up. Me and Mirei are cows, you know.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:16.110
But Hibiki went to all the trouble of arranging this for us...

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:19.700
That's right-kuma. This is a Parademy Award-winning director, after all.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.600
"Let's reborn" – be born anew.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:27.580
To break your cocoon and discover a new radiance within.

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:31.660
No lies pass her metal lips. She <i>is</i> an expert-usa.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.730
A new... radiance.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:41.330
And if the movie becomes a massive hit, it could win another Parademy Award...

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:44.680
SoLaMi SMILE's worldwide renown would skyrocket-kuma!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:49.440
Exactly! Dressing Pafé will take a giant step closer to Divine Idolhood-usa!

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.230
Shion, we believe in you.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:57.340
Are they. Ready yet?

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:59.210
I'll go and see how they're doing.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:04.890
Garu.

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:13.820
Mine ears have heard all! We too shall transcend
the ephemeral and enter that world of dreams!

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:16.470
Aroma says she wants to be in the movie too!

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:19.050
Garu! Garuru's gonna be an actress!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.520
What sense is there in biting <i>me</i>?

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:22.670
I wanna be in the movie too!

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:23.720
Yep, yeppers!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.960
Garu! Garuru's gonna be an actress-garu!
Gonna be in it! Gonna be in it!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:29.310
Our ungodly skills are yours for the taking!

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:36.320
Order. On. My set!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.860
Compulsory jewels!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.120
Oh no, look at our jewels!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.120
They're scattered all over – pick 'em up!

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:49.040
Is this it?

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.570
It's too dark to see-pri!

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.230
Come on, we've gotta hurry!

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:56.010
Jewel Change!

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:02.740
Kuma...

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.160
They made it-nekon.

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:06.640
That was close...

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:07.180
Wait.

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:09.360
What?

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.450
Hm?

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.800
Be born. Anew.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:20.240
Welcome to the Hologrammation Set.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.370
I think I've turned into a cool idol, but I've just pri-come my regular self.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.720
And "pri" feels pri incongruous here, but I can't stop-pri.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:29.950
Pri.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:35.130
I'm pop now! Let's have a staring contest!

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.300
Pop-pu-pu!

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.350
It's a curious sensation, being a celeb idol.

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:43.760
Please, interviews are not permitted.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.250
It appears I'm now a celeb idol.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:49.610
I'll say goodbye to meat buns and partake of truffle buns.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.850
Garuru's a celeb idol too-garu!

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.420
And this dress is simply <i>gorgeous</i>-garu!

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.100
I'm a <i>lovely</i> idol?

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:59.320
The gatekeepers to hell will titter at me like this!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.100
All... "tee hee"...

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.300
Aroma, you look stunning.

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:05.150
Tee-hee! And I'm a lovely idol!

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:06.160
Ba-dump!

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:10.020
The depth of little Doro's charm are on full display!

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.750
Hey... What'd I just call myself?

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.670
Oh, and the holder of that wooden sword must be Shion-chan!

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:21.410
What in blazes... am I wearing?

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:26.560
I'm... stunned and bewildered!

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.510
What a pretty pickle!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:30.220
What a <i>what</i>?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.250
You're cute, Shion.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.440
Reona, you're kind of reminding me of me.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.900
And you of me, Dorothy.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.190
Goodness gracious!

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.250
I... a lovely idol?

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:46.100
The repairs are all done!

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:49.160
It looks as though she's grown somewhat.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.420
She still looks like a walking scrap heap-pri.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:53.040
Reborn!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:57.540
This update. Cannot be reversed.
Until filming. Is complete.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:00.080
Let's make. The greatest movie. <i>Of all time</i>.

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:03.580
Colourful Detective Shion-chan. Take 1.

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:05.880
That's not the same title as before...

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:06.590
Doro-pero!

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.260
Action.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:13.010
Shion, hurry up and act-pri!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:15.920
Surely it'll be easier in that outfit-pri!

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:18.700
You can do it, Shion.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.580
Let me hear that "Shio-poyo".

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:22.100
Shi–<i>on</i>!

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:24.460
Sh–Sh–Shi...

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.330
No way in hell!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.490
Oh, no, I mustn't run indecorously!

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:37.250
My body. It is...

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:38.400
Akai Meganee
for the inconvenience
We apologise
Repair in progress

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.320
Please bear with us for a moment.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.410
Clatter, clatter, bang, bang.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.970
The repairs are all done!

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:47.730
Take 2. Start.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:49.810
Oh, woe is us!

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:53.310
Pop-pu-pu! Pop-pu-pu! Pop-pu-pu!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:55.920
Now. Line.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.140
Sh–Shio...

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:00.660
Pwease, Shion-tan! Pwease say it!

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:01.640
Pwe-ease!

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:05.480
Sh–Sh–Shio...

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:06.570
Poyo.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.860
Wrong!

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:11.740
Good evening. My name is Shion.

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:15.260
I hail from the Land of Rainbows
and I am given to capriciousne–

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:16.040
Cut!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:19.570
I'm Shion! I'm a happy-go-l–

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:21.300
L–L...

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.250
Cut!

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:24.890
Hewwo! I'm Shion-chan!

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:26.910
I'm a happy-go-lucky girl...

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.020
from the Land...

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:31.070
From the high and distinguished Seven-Colour King–

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:31.970
Cut!

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.720
Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.610
The repairs are all done!

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:38.770
Ta–Take. 30.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.530
Not acting is against idol regulations-pri!

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:44.570
Severe danger.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:48.150
The pulses are flowing backwards.
Mechanee is now going berserk.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.200
Oh, phooey!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.640
Shion-chan, you silly billy, quit playing around.

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:53.710
Doro-poyo!

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:54.020
I know! I'm well aware what I must do...

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:56.050
Doro-poyo...

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:56.120
I know! I'm well aware what I must do...

00:14:56.450 --> 00:15:00.080
Say, I can't see Jululu anywhere near!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.580
Mama!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.180
Don't tell me...

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.890
Please wait a moment.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.930
Oh man!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.340
Re. Take.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:30.840
Oh, dear! Mechanee has turned into Mega-Mechanee!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.270
Are you okay?

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:38.190
Miss Shion, please do something!

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.830
Oh no! Jululu is in danger!

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.880
This is all... my responsibility.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:48.050
I shall strike down the foe whom I have created!

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.060
I won't let you go it alone.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.850
Don't hog all the glory for yourself.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.380
It's come to this – let's give it all we've got.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:03.070
A truly lively party.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:04.520
We won't hold back!

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:07.150
If Reona's going, count me in!

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:07.730
Of course.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.610
Da Vinci!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.910
Guess who's showing up?

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.120
Incoming!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.790
Da-Da-Da-Da Vinci!

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:24.620
Da Vinci!

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.380
Say your prayers, tin can!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.700
Not bad for a first timer... lion.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:38.520
My Dalí appearance – we'll Piet Mondrian again tomorrow.

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:40.770
Mega...

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.190
My dear Jululu!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.860
It's no use. She's shrugging off our blows like flies.

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:49.340
So the only way to stop her...

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:53.360
Shion! You have to say "Shio-poyo"-pri!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.720
Jululu!

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:12.800
My back's to the wall!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.330
Oh!

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:19.460
Colourful, colourful, blast those bad feelings away!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.720
Ride the rapturous rainbow! Poyon-poyon, poyoyoyoyoon!

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.140
Poyorin, love!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.560
Ooh! Tee-hee!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:30.640
Twirling, twirling, twirling!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.900
Shio-poyo!

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:35.860
Let's. Reborn!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:43.530
Jululu!

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:47.620
This is. The acting. I dreamed of.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.860
Shion. You are. Its very image.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:54.340
You were. Truly. Born. Anew.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:58.090
You did. It. You did. It.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.300
You did. It.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:01.920
And. Cut.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:04.820
Shion. What wonderful. Acting.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.200
Shion, you were amazing!

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.790
Pri-nspirational!

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:11.340
This is the darkest day of Toudou Shion's life.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.610
Erase it from your memories.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.190
I'm not forgetting <i>anything</i>.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:16.770
I snapped it perfectly, after all.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:20.100
Let's spread it all over Pritter, too.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:20.570
Don't you dare!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.860
Nope, sorry!

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:22.410
Hey!

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:25.340
Here we go, time to upload it!

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:27.080
Cease and desist!

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:28.990
Me–

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:32.900
Damn heap of junk.

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:34.480
And now. The next. Scene.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:46.310
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.230
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:51.680
Starting the Coord Change.

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.910
They protected the peace of PriPara.

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:59.550
Now, for the sake of love, smiling faces and likes, they metamorphose!

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:01.480
Crosswalk Coord!

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:01.880
<i>Go</i>!

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:02.660
Yay!

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:17.650
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:20.450
Gajira!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:21.970
Transform!

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:24.500
Go, PriPara – Change!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.660
Idol warriors!

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:28.170
PriPara Girls!

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:31.040
Lock on!

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:34.220
Gajira...

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:36.360
<i>Go</i>!

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:41.090
Super Cyalume Change!

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:47.730
<i>Go</i>!

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:48.450
Yay!

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:26.400
It's gotta be Shion!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.180
Let's meet. Again.

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.730
Thank you very much!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:35.710
Bye-bye!

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:36.680
Don't you ever come back!

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:37.090
Pip, pip. Pop, pop.

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:38.860
What a pri-ncompetent director.

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:43.530
By the way, it appears the cameras only managed to record the explosions.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.170
What a shame!

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:48.050
You can turn it off now, Andou.

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:48.800
Naa.

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:51.820
Hibiki-san, you're a shameless liar.

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:55.370
30 years ago, Mechanee won a <i>Golden Raspberry</i> Award.

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:57.090
That's for really bad films!

00:21:58.180 --> 00:22:01.250
But it was fun to see a new side of everyone.

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:05.260
Mechanee, you're back earlier than I expected.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:05.760
Good w–

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:08.220
Hello, my frien-Da Vinci!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:12.050
Let's start on a piece together, all by oursel-vador Dalí!

00:22:14.340 --> 00:22:17.090
I am. Mechanee.

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:20.020
I will. Make you. Into. A star.

00:23:51.470 --> 00:23:52.820
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:54.200
Aim to be a Divine Idol!

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:56.360
I became a Divine Idol!

00:23:56.360 --> 00:23:59.460
Then I met Jululu, and became a mama idol!

00:23:59.460 --> 00:24:00.530
Mama!

00:24:00.530 --> 00:24:03.160
Don't you worry, Jululu – I'll try my hardest at both!

00:24:03.160 --> 00:24:04.200
How naïve!

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:05.560
Principal Ookanda?

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:07.890
A student's duty is towards study.

00:24:07.890 --> 00:24:11.790
But you've neglected this duty,
and now you'll suffer the consequences!

00:24:11.790 --> 00:24:12.720
What?

00:24:13.360 --> 00:24:16.860
Next time, <i>I Became an Underachiever Idol (T_T)</i> !

00:24:16.860 --> 00:24:19.850
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
